  "equipment_type": "Variable frequency drive",
  "applies_to": "TECO-Westinghouse E510 Compact (E510N1) inverters with the built-in RS-485 port (CON2), per communication addendum DOCUMENT-TECO-E510N1-AC002 Ver01 (2017-08).",
  "summary": "The E510 Compact is the newer TECO-Westinghouse compact inverter with a built-in RS-485 port speaking Modbus RTU or ASCII (BACnet objects are also described). Commands, frequency, torque and speed limit are written to 2501H-2504H; status, fault and alarm codes and monitors are read from 2520H-252FH. Each parameter nn-mm has its own register, with the group in the high byte and the number in the low byte.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU",
    "ASCII"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": null,
    "baud": null,
    "parity": null,
    "data_bits": null,
    "stop_bits": null,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "hex 0-based",
    "note": "Register numbers are hex and sent unchanged: the 03H example reads start register 01 23 (0123H) and the 06H example writes 01 02. Parameters map group to the high byte and number to the low byte (13-00 = 0D00H), except 12-00 which is a 32-bit value at 2510H (high word) / 2511H (low word)."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": null,
  "source": {
    "title": "E510 Communication Addendum Modbus RTU/ASCII (E510N1)",
    "doc_number": "DOCUMENT-TECO-E510N1-AC002 Ver01",
    "revision_date": "2017-08",
    "url": "https://tecowestinghouse.com/PDF/E510_Compact_comm_addendum.pdf",
    "pages": "pp. 1-1 to 1-4 (connection, frames, exceptions), p. 1-5 (command data), pp. 1-6 to 1-8 (monitor data), parameter registers pp. 1-13 to 1-20"
  },
  "notes": [
    "The addendum does not name the drive parameters for node address, baud rate, parity or run/frequency source; set those per the E510 Compact manual.",
    "2521H (faults) and 2528H (alarms) are code tables, mapped as enums.",
    "Left out: 2505H/252AH AO1 (range 0.00-10.00 V given, raw scale not stated), 2507H DO and 2529H digital output state (no bit list), 252FH value list.",
    "Parameter 12-00 is 32-bit (2510H high word, 2511H low word) but is a parameter, not a monitor, and is not listed."
  ],
